Assumptions (no file gives them): `carnot_fraction` 0.5 (no datasheet; half of Carnot is the usual large-machine figure); `minimum_temperature_lift` 5 K, `minimum_part_load` 0.1, `minimum_source_outlet_temperature` 5 degC (machine limits, no datasheet); `electric_boiler.efficiency` 0.99 (electrode boiler, no datasheet); exchanger `thermal_conductance` 3 MW/K, `nominal_duty` 20 MW, 0.5 bar per side, `fouling_threshold` 0.2, counterflow; pipe lengths 5 km heating / 3 km cooling, diameters 0.5 / 0.4 m, 1 W/m2/K buried insulated, no elevation; cooler dry, 15 MW (above the 10 MW evaporator duty to take the condenser heat), approach 5 K, fan power 2 % of rejected heat, 4 bar loop; grid import 100 MW / export 0; degasser 4 bar, 0.5 bar drop, 0.95 separation; filters 0.3 bar clean, 1 bar alarm, 250 t/h. The consumer and exchanger flows (430 t/h heating, 1720 t/h cooling, 250 t/h brine) are design flows to be confirmed by gemini's `size_plant`, not hand-derived.

